==Description==

The Analysis container holds all objects of a Computational Fluid Dynamic Analysis. This container is mandatory.

==Usage==

# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:CfdOF_Analysis.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_Analysis|Analysis container]]‏‎}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|CfdOF → [[Image:CfdOF_Analysis.svg|16px]] Analysis container‏‎}} option from the menu.
#* Use the keyboard shortcut: {{KEY|N}} then {{KEY|C}}.
# A new CfdAnalysis container is created and set to active.
# The following objects are automatically created inside the container:
#*[[Image:CfdOF_PhysicsModel.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_PhysicsModel|PhysicsModel]] 
#*[[Image:CfdOF_FluidMaterial.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_FluidMaterial|FluidProperties]] 
#*[[Image:CfdOF_InitialiseInternal.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_InitialiseInternal|InitialiseFields]]
#*[[Image:CfdOF_SolverControl.svg|16px]] [[CfdOF_SolverControl|CfdSolver]]
# Additional objects can be added to the container by pressing a CfdOF button or selecting from the CfdOF menu.


